  {
    "id": "2012384073533050901",
    "author": {
      "id": "1495931005857046528",
      "username": "Linguista2025",
      "name": "Linguista",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007818475818061824/EyNsNuqE_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "我去年在刷推之前，主要信息源是hackernews。\n\n在搞推之后，信息摄入的质量是断崖式下滑的。\n\n唯一好点的是我直接手动输出的内容多了。所以还是应当讲写作本身当作X最大的功能，至于获得流量，都是附带的，没流量也没关系。\n\n有一些搞流量的方法很盛行，但那些雕虫小技不值得来影响我的写作风格。",
    "created_at": "2026-01-17T04:38:46.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": 0,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "view_count": 13,
      "impression_count": 13
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "2012382966270365845",
    "author": {
      "id": "1495931005857046528",
      "username": "Linguista2025",
      "name": "Linguista",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007818475818061824/EyNsNuqE_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "真正的核心是创作者的能力，功能都是次要的。目前至少中推上的原创能力很差，长文的平均质量在功能下放后急剧下滑…",
    "created_at": "2026-01-17T04:34:22.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 1,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": 0,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "view_count": 19,
      "impression_count": 19
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "2012382506998169942",
    "author": {
      "id": "1495931005857046528",
      "username": "Linguista2025",
      "name": "Linguista",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007818475818061824/EyNsNuqE_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "之前的X长文可读性还不错，但现在越来越差了。确实X上绝大多数创作者都是水货，也就只有利用AI搞搬运的能力。\n\n这几日，我自己的长文数据也表现一般，目前处于自我怀疑中，不知道该如何继续。可能还是会优先搞博客吧。",
    "created_at": "2026-01-17T04:32:32.000Z",
